---
description: Vitest + RTL unit tests. Use when writing, running, or reviewing tests, or when implementing a feature or bugfix.
alwaysApply: false
---

Red, then green, one seam at a time. Tests live at public interfaces; expected values are literals, not recomputed the way the code does.

## Runner

- Vitest + React Testing Library in `apps/www`. Colocate as `*.test.ts(x)` next to the module.
- `pnpm test` (repo root, turbo) or `pnpm --filter www test`. Watch: `pnpm --filter www test:watch`.
- CI: `.github/workflows/test.yaml` runs `pnpm test` on push/PR to `main`.
- Bookmark sync scripts stay on `node:test` (`apps/www/scripts/lib/*.test.mjs`).

## Seams

Test these public APIs. Do not reach into unexported helpers.

| Seam | Module |
| --- | --- |
| `cn`, `formatTime` | `@/lib/utils` |
| `hostnameOf`, `getCollections`, `getCollection` | `@/lib/bookmarks` |
| `isValidPackageName` | `@/lib/npm-registry` |
| `fetchOg` | `@/lib/og` |
| `BookmarkList`, `CollectionList` | bookmark catalog UI |
| `InspirationGrid` | inspirations pinboard |
| `Section` | layout heading/description |
| `usePackageAnalyzer` | analyzer hook |

Mock system boundaries only: `fetch`, clipboard, `next-intl` messages via `NextIntlClientProvider`. `server-only` is aliased in `vitest.config.ts`. Do not mock modules we own.
